OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after collision
OL,4,Awith car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after he was in
OL,7,Fcollision with a vehicle on a Norfolk
OL,8,Froad.
OL,10,FNorfolk Police confirmed a man in his
OL,11,F60s died at the scene following the
OL,12,Fincident at West Winch, near King's
OL,13,FLynn.
OL,15,FThe collision happened on Monday at
OL,16,F16:11 BST on the A10 between the
OL,17,Fjunctions of Long Lane and Watering
OL,18,FLane and involved a black Kia Ceed.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
